#: blocks/monthly-forecast/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Monthly Forecast"
msgstr "AstroWay：月間占い"

#: blocks/monthly-forecast/block.json
msgid ""
"Four weeks ahead for one sign, each week with its own theme, served as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr "ある星座について4週間先までの情報（各週ごとに独自のテーマが設定されている）が、レスポンシブなiframeとして表示されていました。"

#: blocks/monthly-horoscope/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Monthly Horoscope"
msgstr "AstroWay：月間占い"

#: blocks/monthly-horoscope/block.json
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current month, anchored to the 1st, rendered into the page"
" as text."
msgstr "今月の星占い（1日を基準として）を、テキストとしてページに表示します。"

#: blocks/moon-phase/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Moon Phase"
msgstr "アストロウェイ: 月相"

#: blocks/moon-phase/block.json
msgid "Current moon phase with illumination percentage."
msgstr "照度パーセント付きの現在の月相"

#: blocks/moon-sign/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Moon Sign"
msgstr "AstroWay: 月星座"

#: blocks/moon-sign/block.json
msgid "The Moon's sign, degree and house from a birth chart."
msgstr "出生図から月の星座、度数、ハウスを表示します。"

#: blocks/moon-voc/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Void of Course Moon"
msgstr "AstroWay：空の月"

#: blocks/moon-voc/block.json
msgid "Whether the Moon is void of course, and the windows around now."
msgstr "月が「空の月」の状態にあるかどうか、そして今頃の見通しについて。"

#: blocks/natal-chart/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Natal Chart"
msgstr "アストロウェイ: 出生図"

#: blocks/natal-chart/block.json
msgid "Natal chart wheel served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "レスポンシブ iframe で提供される api.astroway.info の出生図"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Numerology"
msgstr "アストロウェイ: 月相"

#: blocks/numerology/block.json
msgid ""
"Numerology core numbers (Life Path, Expression, Soul Urge, Personality) "
"served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "レスポンシブ iframe で提供される api.astroway.info の出生図"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Daily Panchang"
msgstr "アストロウェイ: 今日のタロット"

#: blocks/panchang/block.json
msgid ""
"Daily Panchang (tithi, nakshatra, yoga, karana, vara, rahu-kaal) for a date "
"and location, served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "レスポンシブ iframe で提供される api.astroway.info の出生図"

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Planet of the Day"
msgstr "AstroWay：今日の惑星"

#: blocks/planet-of-day/block.json
msgid ""
"Traditional planetary ruler of the weekday, with its glyph and themes, "
"rendered into the page."
msgstr "その曜日を伝統的に支配する惑星、その記号やテーマがページに表現されている。"

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Planetary Hours"
msgstr "AstroWay：惑星の時間"

#: blocks/planetary-hours/block.json
msgid ""
"The twenty-four planetary hours of a day at one place, with the current one "
"marked."
msgstr "ある場所における1日の24の惑星時間。現在時刻には印が付いています。"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Retrograde Status"
msgstr "AstroWay：逆行状況"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgid "Whether one planet is retrograde right now, and when that changes."
msgstr "現在、ある惑星が逆行しているかどうか、そしてそれがいつ変わるのか。"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Retrograde Planets"
msgstr "AstroWay：逆行する惑星"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgid "All eight planets that station, and what each is doing today."
msgstr "停滞している8つの惑星すべてと、今日それぞれの惑星がどのような動きを見せているか。"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Rising Sign"
msgstr "AstroWay: 上昇星座"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is "
"the horizon at a place."
msgstr "上昇星座とそのチャート支配星を表示します。座標が必要です：アセンダントはその場所の地平線です。"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Synastry Compatibility"
msgstr "アストロウェイ: 出生図"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgid ""
"Synastry compatibility score and top inter-aspects for two birth charts, "
"served by api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "レスポンシブ iframe で提供される api.astroway.info の出生図"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Moon Transit Timeline"
msgstr "AstroWay：月の通過スケジュール"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr "api.astroway.info がレスポンシブな iframe として提供する、今後 7 日間の月の入宮情報。"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Transit Sky"
msgstr "アストロウェイ: 出生図"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr "レスポンシブ iframe で提供される api.astroway.info の出生図"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgid "AstroWay: Weekly Horoscope"
msgstr "AstroWay：週間占い"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page "
"as text."
msgstr "月曜日を基準とした今週の星占い。ページ上にテキストとして表示されます。"
